  "baseline": {
   "title": "Elimu+ Day 0 Baseline",
   "description": "Complete this once for every participant at the start, in the first two days. It records who they are, where they start and what they hope for, so that the 30, 60 and 90 day visits can show real change. Part A is the same for everyone; then choose adult or youth. Ask money and household questions last, and gently.",
